    'missions.status.research': 'In exploration', 'missions.status.ongoing': 'Ongoing',
    'missions.status.serviceActive': 'Active',
    'missions.items.nacodev.name': 'NacoDev',
    'missions.items.nacodev.description': 'My digital laboratory: a space for turning ideas into products, automations and tangible experiences.',
    'missions.items.nacodev.category': 'Products · systems · experimentation',
    'missions.items.nacodev.transmission.headerLabel': 'LAB / BUILD',
    'missions.items.nacodev.transmission.subtitle': 'My personal digital laboratory.',
    'missions.items.nacodev.transmission.paragraph1': 'NacoDev was born in 2021 from a simple idea: to have a space of my own to learn, experiment and build.',
    'missions.items.nacodev.transmission.paragraph2': 'It began as my micro-enterprise and a space for building websites. Over time, NacoDev grew into something much broader: a laboratory where I test technologies, learn new languages, prototype tools, automate tasks and turn some ideas into more ambitious products.',
    'missions.items.nacodev.transmission.paragraph3': 'I can move from a brochure website to an application, from an automation script to infrastructure, or from an experimental interface to a new product. The subject changes, but the logic stays the same: understand, try, build and improve.',
    'missions.items.nacodev.transmission.paragraph4': 'NacoDev is also a way to document that progress. V1 mainly told the story of my early days in web development. V2 better reflects what I do today: digital products, systems, automation, AI and experimentation.',
    'missions.items.nacodev.transmission.trajectoryLabel': 'NacoDev trajectory, from version 1 to version 2',
