    'missions.items.privateSystems.name': 'Private systems',
    'missions.items.privateSystems.description': 'Designing reliable, secure digital environments for private individuals, independent professionals and small businesses: networking, Wi‑Fi, security, equipment and custom workstations.',
    'missions.items.privateSystems.category': 'Infrastructure · Security · Guidance',
    'missions.items.privateSystems.transmission.headerLabel': 'INFRA / SECURE',
    'missions.items.privateSystems.transmission.subtitle': 'Digital infrastructure designed to last.',
    'missions.items.privateSystems.transmission.paragraph1': 'Private Systems starts with a simple observation: today, a home, a freelancer or a small business can depend on an essential digital environment that was never truly designed as a system.',
    'missions.items.privateSystems.transmission.paragraph2': 'Networks, Wi‑Fi, workstations, security, equipment, storage, backups and performance all add up. When nothing is structured, the whole environment quickly becomes difficult to understand, maintain and evolve.',
    'missions.items.privateSystems.transmission.paragraph3': 'The objective is to design environments that are more reliable, easier to understand and better suited to real-world use. This can range from improving a network and securing access to organising equipment or assembling custom workstations.',
    'missions.items.privateSystems.transmission.paragraph4': 'The idea is not to impose a standard solution, but to build something coherent around the location, constraints, needs and people who will actually use the system every day.',
    'missions.items.privateSystems.transmission.paragraph5': 'Good infrastructure should not be purely technical. It must be stable, understandable, secure and able to evolve without becoming unnecessarily complex.',
    'missions.items.privateSystems.transmission.scopeLabel': 'Continuity across digital environments',
    'missions.items.privateSystems.transmission.scopeStart': 'Home · Freelancer',
    'missions.items.privateSystems.transmission.scopeEnd': 'Small organisation · SME',
